{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_13207","headline":"宿淮阴南楼酬常伯能 · 皇甫冉","name":"宿淮阴南楼酬常伯能","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"淮阴日落上南楼，乔木荒城古渡头。\n浦外野风初入户，窗中海月早知秋。\n沧波一望通千里，画角三声起百忧。\n伫立分宵绝来客，烦君步屐忽相求。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"皇甫冉","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_13207.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_13207","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry、古籍注评：《唐诗鼓吹》（中文维基文库，CC BY-SA 4.0，https://zh.wikisource.org/wiki/唐詩鼔吹_(四庫全書本)）"}